  "body": "Following a significant price repositioning this exceptional Stanley Point Property now offers one of the most compelling buying opportunities currently available on the North Shore. Secure a premium address and add value through renovation in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nAfter 25 wonderful years, our vendors have downsized, offering the opportunity. \r\n\r\nOriginally built in the 1920s and thoughtfully updated in the early 1990s, this impressive 370-square-metre residence sits proudly on a level 1,419-square-metre site with a well-engineered palisade retaining wall which assists in securing the southern cliffside, while the home's north-south orientation captures breathtaking harbour and city views.\r\n\r\nTo the south, enjoy panoramic vistas across the Waitemata Harbour, including the iconic Auckland Harbour Bridge and Sky Tower. To the north, soak in views over the Bayswater Marina and beyond.\r\n\r\nInside, the scale is immediately apparent. Generous living spaces include an entrance hall, formal lounge, separate dining room, an expansive kitchen, four spacious bedrooms including a master with ensuite, a dedicated library, and a charming retro-style cinema/media room.\r\n\r\nBoth the lounge and master suite flow seamlessly to an entertainer's deck on the southern side, where you'll watch ships and yachts glide across the harbour against Auckland's glittering skyline, truly living in the \"City of Sails.\"\r\n\r\nOn the northern side, the kitchen and dining areas open to a sun-soaked deck overlooking a large swimming pool, the perfect setting for family living and summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nThis classic beauty presents an exceptional opportunity for a visionary buyer to refresh and elevate her for the years ahead, unlocking the full potential of this substantial home.\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes from Devonport Village, you'll enjoy boutique shopping, vibrant cafes and restaurants, and an easy 15-minute ferry commute to Auckland's CBD, whilst top schools are a bus ride away.\r\n\r\n69 Stanley Point Road offers scale, position, privacy, and extraordinary views. This is a rare chance to secure a landmark property in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal suburbs. \r\n\r\nIGNORE the council valuation, all reasonable offers will be presented!\r\n\r\nWe look forward to welcoming you at one of our open homes, or we would be delighted to arrange a private viewing at your convenience.",
